A Bevy {{dimension}} game with Rapier physics.{% if networked %} Lightyear networking is enabled.{% endif %}

Install Rust and native libraries using [Bevy's setup guide](https://bevy.org/learn/quick-start/getting-started/setup/),
or run `nix develop` for the pinned environment.

```sh
cargo xtask setup
cargo run -p {{project-name}}
```

WASD or arrows move the player; Space boosts movement.
{% if networked %}The left gamepad stick and south button also control movement and boost.
{% endif %}
